{"step_index":596,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T22:38:50Z","input_tokens":2726,"cache_read_tokens":128868,"output_tokens":2084,"thinking":"Initial hypothesis: when the \"Auto Record Quiz\" feature is enabled, the interface needs adjustments to reflect automatic submission. Specifically, download and copy options should be hidden, and the instruction text updated.\nThe primary HTML file (`index.html`) requires modification.\nThe elements with IDs `#dl` (download container) and `#cp` (copy container) must be hidden. The instruction note displayed below the score needs to be revised to reflect the automatic submission rather than manual download/copy actions.\n\n\nThe interface adjustments involve hiding download/copy UI elements and updating the instruction text in `index.html`. Also, `<button id=\"lkdl\">Download Result File</button>` needs to be hidden when re-opening a completed quiz on `#lock`. In `teacher.html`, the auto-record button (`#btn-auto-rec`) should bind to `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` and persist the setting to Firestore. This requires detailed verification of the changes. The changes are non-major; thus, the update needs to be documented in `HISTORY.md`, following the specified format. The `implementation_plan.md` artifact will be used for planning.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan to conditionally hide result download and copy buttons and update instruction copy when auto submission is active.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","Content":"\"# Implementation Plan: Auto Submission Mode - Hide Result File/Code & Update Instructions\\n\\n## 1. Overview of Requested Changes\\n\\n1. **Conditional Result Action Display in [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html)**:\\n   - When `autoRecordQuiz` is active (`settings.autoRecordQuiz !== false`):\\n     - Hide the download and copy buttons (`#dl` \\\"Download Result File\\\" and `#cp` \\\"Copy Result Code\\\").\\n     - Update the result card's instructions paragraph from:\\n       `\\\"Give the downloaded file or the result code to your instructor. Your result is also saved on this device.\\\"`\\n       to:\\n       `\\\"Your response has been automatically submitted to your instructor. Your result is also saved on this device.\\\"`\\n     - On the lock screen (`#lock`), hide `#lkdl` (\\\"Download Result File\\\").\\n   - When `autoRecordQuiz === false`:\\n     - Keep the buttons visible and retain the original manual file/code submission instruction.\\n\\n2. **Connect Setting in [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)**:\\n   - Wire `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` to the existing `#btn-auto-rec` toggle (default `true`).\\n   - Persist `autoRecordQuiz` in the Firestore settings payload on \\\"Save to Quiz\\\".\\n   - Sync `syncOptionsUI()` to reflect the loaded `autoRecordQuiz` state from Firestore.\\n\\n3. **Re-sync Firestore Template**:\\n   - Synchronize `quizzes/template` in Firestore so downloaded quiz files contain the updated conditional logic.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. File Modifications\\n\\n### 2.1 [teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)\\n- In `settingsState`:\\n  Add `autoRecordQuiz: true`.\\n- In `syncOptionsUI()`:\\n  Update `#btn-auto-rec` to use `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz`.\\n- In `btn-auto-rec.onclick`:\\n  Toggle `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz = !settingsState.autoRecordQuiz; syncOptionsUI();`.\\n- In `save-btn.onclick`:\\n  `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` is saved as part of `settingsState` into Firestore `quizzes/{quizId}`.\\n\\n### 2.2 [index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdm\n<truncated 3121 bytes>","Overwrite":"true","Path":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\CxAdmin\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a\\\\implementation_plan.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
