{"step_index":598,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T22:39:05Z","input_tokens":2179,"cache_read_tokens":131600,"output_tokens":438,"content":"I have analyzed the requirements and prepared the implementation plan:\n\n### Summary of Proposed Plan\n1. **[teacher.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/teacher.html)**:\n   - Wire the `Auto Record Quiz` toggle (`#btn-auto-rec`) to `settingsState.autoRecordQuiz` (default: `true`).\n   - Persist this setting to Firestore on \"Save to Quiz\" so the student quiz automatically inherits the mode.\n2. **[index.html](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/index.html)**:\n   - When auto submission is active (`autoRecordQuiz !== false`):\n     - Hide the **Download Result File** and **Copy Result Code** buttons on the results card.\n     - Hide the download button on the lock screen.\n     - Update the results card instruction from:\n       > *\"Give the downloaded file or the result code to your instructor. Your result is also saved on this device.\"*\n       to:\n       > *\"Your response has been automatically submitted to your instructor. Your result is also saved on this device.\"*\n   - If auto submission is turned off in settings, restore the download/copy buttons and original instructions.\n3. **Firestore & History**:\n   - Re-sync Firestore `quizzes/template`.\n   - Append Non-Major Patch 1.0.14 to [HISTORY.md](file:///c:/Users/CxAdmin/Desktop/Exploit/HISTORY.md) per Rule 1.\n\nPlease review the [implementation plan](file:///C:/Users/CxAdmin/.gemini/antigravity/brain/8f2bd4b5-d81b-4839-aa40-a5c3a5acaa6a/implementation_plan.md) and reply with **\"proceed\"** (or click the Proceed button) so I can implement these changes."}
